cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data in your research, please cite the associated paper as below."
type: software
title: "African Dormice: Phylogenomics and Systematic Revision of Graphiurus (Gliridae)"
abstract: >
  Analysis code and processed data for a comprehensive phylogenomic and taxonomic revision
  of African Dormice (Graphiurus, Gliridae), integrating cytochrome B and ultraconserved
  element (UCE) datasets with species delimitation, divergence dating, biogeographic
  reconstruction, and morphometric analyses.
